    "created_at": "2026-01-07T13:41:44Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-07T13:41:44Z",
    "body": "@zcorpan @annevk @sirreal \nHi, thank you for raising and discussing this issue.\n\nI’m interested in contributing by adding Web Platform Tests for the compatMode behavior in the cases where the DOCTYPE system identifier is missing vs. an empty string. Before I start, I’d like to confirm that adding such WPT tests would still be helpful for moving this issue forward, and whether there are any specific edge cases or existing tests I should be aware of or build upon.\n\nIf this direction sounds good, I’ll prepare a pull request with the proposed tests and share it here.\n\nThank you!",
    "author_association": "NONE",
